{"id":"26dec4f877ca3671","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-pred-fibration.md","title":"df-predicate-fibration","display":"df-predicate-fibration","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-pred-fibration","aliases":["16-df-pred-fibration","Predicate fibration"],"display":"df-predicate-fibration","depends_on":["[[16-df-pred-category]]","[[16-df-fibration]]","[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-19"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-pred-fibration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-pred-fibration</span><span>Predicate fibration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-predicate-fibration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d576fa154ddad647\" href=\"?note=d576fa154ddad647\" title=\"16-df-pred-category\">16-df-pred-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d576fa154ddad647\" href=\"?note=d576fa154ddad647\" title=\"16-df-pred-category\">16-df-pred-category</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 与规范投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U}\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(p:\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U}\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 为同源同靶候选函子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fib}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fib}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span> 是小集合函数图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,X&#39;\\subseteq I\">\\(X,X&#39;\\subseteq I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y,Y&#39;\\subseteq J\">\\(Y,Y&#39;\\subseteq J\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq X&#39;\">\\(X\\subseteq X&#39;\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\subseteq Y&#39;\">\\(Y\\subseteq Y&#39;\\)</span>。下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*,\\Sigma_u,\\Pi_u\">\\(u^*,\\Sigma_u,\\Pi_u\\)</span> 为幂集之间的函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{u^*},\\widehat{\\Sigma_u},\\widehat{\\Pi_u}\">\\(\\widehat{u^*},\\widehat{\\Sigma_u},\\widehat{\\Pi_u}\\)</span> 是下文给全两个分量的纤维间函子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}_I,\\operatorname{id}_J\">\\(\\operatorname{id}_I,\\operatorname{id}_J\\)</span> 在 Pred 箭头记录的第三分量内指恒等函数图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dashv\">\\(\\dashv\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a> 的函子伴随定义。</li>\n<li>箭头采用规范页的源靶标签，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa(u,(J,Y))\">\\(\\kappa(u,(J,Y))\\)</span> 是下式构造的提升；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PredFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{PredFib}\\)</span> 是下文定义的谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nu^*(Y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{i\\in I\\mid u(i)\\in Y\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_u(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{j\\in J\\mid(\\exists i\\in X)\\ u(i)=j\\},\\\\\n\\Pi_u(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{j\\in J\\mid(\\forall i\\in I)\\ (u(i)=j\\Longrightarrow i\\in X)\\},\\\\\n\\widehat{u^*}_0(J,Y)&amp;\\coloneqq(I,u^*Y),\\\\\n\\widehat{u^*}_1\\langle(J,Y),(J,Y&#39;),\\operatorname{id}_J\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(I,u^*Y),(I,u^*Y&#39;),\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle,\\\\\n\\widehat{\\Sigma_u}_0(I,X)&amp;\\coloneqq(J,\\Sigma_uX),\\\\\n\\widehat{\\Sigma_u}_1\\langle(I,X),(I,X&#39;),\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(J,\\Sigma_uX),(J,\\Sigma_uX&#39;),\\operatorname{id}_J\\rangle,\\\\\n\\widehat{\\Pi_u}_0(I,X)&amp;\\coloneqq(J,\\Pi_uX),\\\\\n\\widehat{\\Pi_u}_1\\langle(I,X),(I,X&#39;),\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(J,\\Pi_uX),(J,\\Pi_uX&#39;),\\operatorname{id}_J\\rangle,\\\\\n\\widehat{u^*}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\widehat{u^*}_0,\\widehat{u^*}_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\widehat{\\Sigma_u}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\widehat{\\Sigma_u}_0,\\widehat{\\Sigma_u}_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\widehat{\\Pi_u}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\widehat{\\Pi_u}_0,\\widehat{\\Pi_u}_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\kappa(u,(J,Y))&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(I,u^*Y),(J,Y),u\\rangle,\\\\\n\\Sigma_uX\\subseteq Y&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow X\\subseteq u^*Y,\\\\\nu^*Y\\subseteq X&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow Y\\subseteq\\Pi_uX,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\widehat{u^*},(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_J,(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_I)&amp;,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\widehat{\\Sigma_u},(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_I,(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_J)&amp;,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\widehat{\\Pi_u},(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_I,(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_J)&amp;,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fib}(p)&amp;,\\qquad\\widehat{\\Sigma_u}\\dashv\\widehat{u^*}\\dashv\\widehat{\\Pi_u},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PredFib}(q)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow q=p.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nu^*(Y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{i\\in I\\mid u(i)\\in Y\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_u(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{j\\in J\\mid(\\exists i\\in X)\\ u(i)=j\\},\\\\\n\\Pi_u(X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{j\\in J\\mid(\\forall i\\in I)\\ (u(i)=j\\Longrightarrow i\\in X)\\},\\\\\n\\widehat{u^*}_0(J,Y)&amp;\\coloneqq(I,u^*Y),\\\\\n\\widehat{u^*}_1\\langle(J,Y),(J,Y&#39;),\\operatorname{id}_J\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(I,u^*Y),(I,u^*Y&#39;),\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle,\\\\\n\\widehat{\\Sigma_u}_0(I,X)&amp;\\coloneqq(J,\\Sigma_uX),\\\\\n\\widehat{\\Sigma_u}_1\\langle(I,X),(I,X&#39;),\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(J,\\Sigma_uX),(J,\\Sigma_uX&#39;),\\operatorname{id}_J\\rangle,\\\\\n\\widehat{\\Pi_u}_0(I,X)&amp;\\coloneqq(J,\\Pi_uX),\\\\\n\\widehat{\\Pi_u}_1\\langle(I,X),(I,X&#39;),\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(J,\\Pi_uX),(J,\\Pi_uX&#39;),\\operatorname{id}_J\\rangle,\\\\\n\\widehat{u^*}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\widehat{u^*}_0,\\widehat{u^*}_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\widehat{\\Sigma_u}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\widehat{\\Sigma_u}_0,\\widehat{\\Sigma_u}_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\widehat{\\Pi_u}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\widehat{\\Pi_u}_0,\\widehat{\\Pi_u}_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\kappa(u,(J,Y))&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(I,u^*Y),(J,Y),u\\rangle,\\\\\n\\Sigma_uX\\subseteq Y&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow X\\subseteq u^*Y,\\\\\nu^*Y\\subseteq X&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow Y\\subseteq\\Pi_uX,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\widehat{u^*},(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_J,(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_I)&amp;,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\widehat{\\Sigma_u},(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_I,(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_J)&amp;,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\widehat{\\Pi_u},(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_I,(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_J)&amp;,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fib}(p)&amp;,\\qquad\\widehat{\\Sigma_u}\\dashv\\widehat{u^*}\\dashv\\widehat{\\Pi_u},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PredFib}(q)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow q=p.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：§0.2，pp.11–13（PDF31–33）；一般函数上的量词为该集合模型的直接展开。投影沿用同一个规范构造，不另写一份可能漂移的恒等、复合或投影数据。</p>\n<p>任意箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:(K,Z)\\to(J,Y)\">\\(f:(K,Z)\\to(J,Y)\\)</span> 若底层函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"uv\">\\(uv\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\\subseteq(uv)^{-1}Y\">\\(Z\\subseteq(uv)^{-1}Y\\)</span>，唯一因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle(K,Z),(I,u^*Y),v\\rangle\">\\(\\langle(K,Z),(I,u^*Y),v\\rangle\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 笛卡尔。两个子集等价式逐元素成立，因而给出显示的伴随；在空原像上全称条件为真。幂集公式始终经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_I\">\\(b_I\\)</span> 对应纤维，不把子集当作带标签的原对象。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-pred-category","status":"resolved","id":"d576fa154ddad647","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pred-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pred-category","status":"resolved","id":"d576fa154ddad647","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[16-df-pred-category]] 的 $\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U}$ 与规范投影 $p:\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U}\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$；$q$ 为同源同靶候选函子。$\\mathrm{Fib}$ 采用 [[16-df-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[16-df-pred-category]] 的 $\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U}$ 与规范投影 $p:\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U}\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$；$q$ 为同源同靶候选函子。$\\mathrm{Fib}$ 采用 [[16-df-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$u:I\\to J$ 是小集合函数图，$X,X'\\subseteq I$、$Y,Y'\\subseteq J$，$X\\subseteq X'$、$Y\\subseteq Y'$。下文 $u^*,\\Sigma_u,\\Pi_u$ 为幂集之间的函数；$\\widehat{u^*},\\widehat{\\Sigma_u},\\widehat{\\Pi_u}$ 是下文给全两个分量的纤维间函子。$\\operatorname{id}_I,\\operatorname{id}_J$ 在 Pred 箭头记录的第三分量内指恒等函数图；$\\dashv$ 使用 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]] 的函子伴随定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U}\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fib}","display":false},{"tex":"u:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"X,X'\\subseteq I","display":false},{"tex":"Y,Y'\\subseteq J","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq X'","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\subseteq Y'","display":false},{"tex":"u^*,\\Sigma_u,\\Pi_u","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat{u^*},\\widehat{\\Sigma_u},\\widehat{\\Pi_u}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{id}_I,\\operatorname{id}_J","display":false},{"tex":"\\dashv","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa(u,(J,Y))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PredFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nu^*(Y)&\\coloneqq\\{i\\in I\\mid u(i)\\in Y\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_u(X)&\\coloneqq\\{j\\in J\\mid(\\exists i\\in X)\\ u(i)=j\\},\\\\\n\\Pi_u(X)&\\coloneqq\\{j\\in J\\mid(\\forall i\\in I)\\ (u(i)=j\\Longrightarrow i\\in X)\\},\\\\\n\\widehat{u^*}_0(J,Y)&\\coloneqq(I,u^*Y),\\\\\n\\widehat{u^*}_1\\langle(J,Y),(J,Y'),\\operatorname{id}_J\\rangle\n&\\coloneqq\\langle(I,u^*Y),(I,u^*Y'),\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle,\\\\\n\\widehat{\\Sigma_u}_0(I,X)&\\coloneqq(J,\\Sigma_uX),\\\\\n\\widehat{\\Sigma_u}_1\\langle(I,X),(I,X'),\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle\n&\\coloneqq\\langle(J,\\Sigma_uX),(J,\\Sigma_uX'),\\operatorname{id}_J\\rangle,\\\\\n\\widehat{\\Pi_u}_0(I,X)&\\coloneqq(J,\\Pi_uX),\\\\\n\\widehat{\\Pi_u}_1\\langle(I,X),(I,X'),\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle\n&\\coloneqq\\langle(J,\\Pi_uX),(J,\\Pi_uX'),\\operatorname{id}_J\\rangle,\\\\\n\\widehat{u^*}&\\coloneqq\\langle\\widehat{u^*}_0,\\widehat{u^*}_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\widehat{\\Sigma_u}&\\coloneqq\\langle\\widehat{\\Sigma_u}_0,\\widehat{\\Sigma_u}_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\widehat{\\Pi_u}&\\coloneqq\\langle\\widehat{\\Pi_u}_0,\\widehat{\\Pi_u}_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\kappa(u,(J,Y))&\\coloneqq\\langle(I,u^*Y),(J,Y),u\\rangle,\\\\\n\\Sigma_uX\\subseteq Y&\\Longleftrightarrow X\\subseteq u^*Y,\\\\\nu^*Y\\subseteq X&\\Longleftrightarrow Y\\subseteq\\Pi_uX,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\widehat{u^*},(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_J,(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_I)&,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\widehat{\\Sigma_u},(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_I,(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_J)&,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\widehat{\\Pi_u},(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_I,(\\mathbf{Pred}_{\\mathcal U})_J)&,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fib}(p)&,\\qquad\\widehat{\\Sigma_u}\\dashv\\widehat{u^*}\\dashv\\widehat{\\Pi_u},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PredFib}(q)&\\Longleftrightarrow q=p.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"f:(K,Z)\\to(J,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"uv","display":false},{"tex":"Z\\subseteq(uv)^{-1}Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle(K,Z),(I,u^*Y),v\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"b_I","display":false}],"bytes":3416,"backlinks":[{"id":"354db91582c53088","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PredFib}$ 取 [[16-df-pred-fibration]] 的规范投影谓词；$\\mathrm{PredFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 是本页定义的兼容谓词。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-300","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-pred-fibration|df-predicate-fibration]]"},{"id":"040fbbfdb52f2389","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["d576fa154ddad647","c9801f31ec8ac53f","fc49efccd7348d66","a88937ea87ff8530"]}